Package: zephyr
Architecture: all
Depends:
    python3,
    ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
    bash-completion
Description: Multi-language CLI project templates and helper tools
 zephyr ships language templates for small command-line utilities under
 /usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/ (bash, c, clib, cs, erlang, go, haskell, java,
 perl, python, rust, smalltalk, swift, typescript), plus cmdline tools
 (zephyr, zephyr-create, zephyr-rename, zephyr-add, zephyr-remove) to create
 projects and manage puffs (example apps).
